      "hash": "572cd72feb9a84e0c639af3ccae73f3a4406f69fe193eac69ab0678eee32baff"
    },
    {
      "id": "91c2e7ec13b3c0e029692db0cc1651365b21757613119ac3b31322739c961032",
      "text": "LLM Fundamentals",
      "hash": "a27078bfc6b5fd60b2c2ea51e3db5de7f1f14bf68278506ea5f18e4af3301a43"
    },
    {
      "id": "d80c41bf7ff9b288831ea959ffab01ecb2dfe9c988bb2f07f3bd883ca74c775e",
      "text": "AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "29a768799acab15b5a0ee28f241b6e057d0b5ff706c70c3edf7f24676f3d77a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "0bd41305271bbd4635368d39b743de511044a22b1e15697e5f30ffad640f6126",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7c5b3c94a5047936eeac2639db82cdcb617a40aaee3be97cb45bafdfcc19a2f",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec2a37263ad086eeceb77dcc273e3a8f34f2547bcb13a0a799314acc030f3b18",
      "text": "Creating The Perfect Claude Code Status Line",
      "hash": "bc4c57542ded814b79775d72e1dc31fc4a80cdc8c55f4fa34da5bf9cc9ba522f"
    },
    {
      "id": "55e7fb65f9c9b7e640fd2d0d776f471ebe7b414b503bf1942150cbb76bd27fad",
      "text": "I've created the perfect Claude Code statusline - including git info and context used. Here's a step-by-step guide.",
      "hash": "e53b9912e35daeb89aec46d0bf82f9fa86ff6afba88d3d120ab3ec2b6581488b"
    },
    {
      "id": "159f66e23b36d23c6e5f5c6be8c9b8cb17dcff4b9bb6d82e44f1c59805c02663",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "20bef7544239edeb390a6c90494241665b594a6bf420372786b665d8c1d91a1b",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "da12e25ce4dcbc0c9448c68b208fe8a250f4d21b46ae5529f13bc6e6b43cc8e4",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bc06318e6e0bf75985cf9c7d384b240b12867ea0701f08cfeed74e486667bf3f",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "817c9cfd4444d9ec796ecc74f62b7c07baf0f890dff4a325b4301f2692128d48",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f1224269801d6ab794378c1a797a56135259c99d17fac9ee601c6c4d71963c0",
      "text": "What Should A Claude Code Status Line Show?",
      "hash": "619d540a65c3c21a7342fbf8e0b836b42ec25ede2145351711b349efa0692c59"
    },
    {
      "id": "f64df9f1c14efa00369f19e1791c2cf628f4e6af681f742287c3b35fa39ad13c",
      "text": "How It's Set Up",
      "hash": "701e11ac467fa3942d2c7b44757759e6eb9541cfa12fd7646aa93a1b3ff41be4"
    },
    {
      "id": "810225b1acd5f4ea24157d585be9f42db046e7f872eabf688f42004a558a7ee3",
      "text": "Try It Yourself",
      "hash": "6cc247079cbab65dfd8368b03835cdb128cd51347d0c0a713bcf6b578787715e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bfae92a09e271d0b856afd12d7ff9263d967be9ceffec48a5513494d7d7de788",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "daa97c080a18bd7317bef1300fbfacbad2e4edf8aef8095d23a6f1b3a4c8fa45",
      "text": "I think I've created the perfect Claude code status line:",
      "hash": "31df6543093927db8b58255d434bbe68a6ee1f65d15acfe16667e045fd745858"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a9b92efcea403eb6ea18aebd7b7fd4577aceab56214557246e896c97d59b62d",
      "text": "First, it has the repo that I'm working on relative to my repository's directory (",
      "hash": "44d6231321f2a0df069ca8703792695e7a2eca096e0d1947577321da4f4a9ce3"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e6206de3902fe49390611f1e2ce1034fa0a7ca3b9521417c2c33d11a34c978a",
      "text": "). If you're like me, you probably have a single directory that has all of your repositories on.",
      "hash": "cd6dee0c3815de822b1c641179743f15b7d7899c2b9b772fe3f5dcf4c793c3f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "570a7c6de6a1473239ab2946e65946e0657dc7caba49350aeec24a7fbbe86c98",
      "text": "So I have it set up in my status line just to show the relative path based on my",
      "hash": "2267b45338f0ce585cef85709ce264787a57cfeeab799a936c18909c68086e58"
    },
    {
      "id": "bea88a5221615daeaaeb585b0bd3ddbf89260fe5c9e11070783d6e213584df07",
      "text": "directory.",
      "hash": "07e4482e146a42c0b7d8ee52a30de5914bda6f4931792c600a9e8a0868aa3122"
    },
    {
      "id": "522170f01107a5e6bd379eec7de862dfa585c9e9ea2ef3f459af6c339bb9a82e",
      "text": "Then I have some Git information:",
      "hash": "27fcbd31d6f396411d513a13e9158a2f23aa9c891dc5d2d6b6ff7a7b783c2ab9"
    },
    {
      "id": "92a581b3fca2e64ca0ccb516a4cc83f0014a65b281fc0bbff38691dcd951ffe5",
      "text": "I have the branch that I'm on and I have the staged, unstaged, and added changes. This is kind of optional, but I do like it just to be able to, when I'm only working in the terminal and you're not using an IDE, see what's happening in Git at all times.",
      "hash": "15cf974883346e0fa48607e35d97405283e5829fce442e734b6a40357ae89d26"
    },
    {
      "id": "f283a4d9c932bc88e8e39b93cd38a922d0e2d8ac40b53c71d47bf502ad12f2d0",
      "text": "And then finally, and this is the most important one, is the percentage of",
      "hash": "840af684fcd1d7133952737a99a09c1df68829421f4c35b91bfabb8176cb659b"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7cf9ed3655a782e7ecfc7bf67742545d0bba6140d70b9d36d4433e20adfbc50",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "81fa3c710921b8d67dea22450ffc3616b037a0254d7e168e06ace911f5ead05a",
      "text": "that I've used up in this session:",
      "hash": "0b66293b2bc0de63e9e45899347def8892b6d45bbad59e3a15b8c424d29fdb56"
    },
    {
      "id": "3afbd6c2fb73cee116d8f8e95c9b0b40da323bebe7d3b652575d649583d4738e",
      "text": "This is a constant source of paranoia for me. I always want to be using the minimum amount of context I can, because the more you put in the context window, the worse the AI is going to be.",
      "hash": "3ee0f47f0b54943f97f8560b8ac602b792e077e5e93e220326ecc03e4dba08ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "902257e7756f83e40d3b82eb2726912d4355567622abda67772b70c4bd417745",
      "text": "Having this constantly at my fingertips and monitoring it going, \"Ooh, I think about 60 is probably where I want to stop\" is just amazing.",
      "hash": "0b978925bb988e1ff86b826cb55664a629361ac543ec260ac34625cc6029cb99"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7cf5ce771952e662bf9b0835f1161a5f6bb386b7d86b144625946c5caa37412",
      "text": "A useful Claude Code status line should show the facts you need before you decide what to do next.",
      "hash": "c09e2f2fddd637b2348b71f84be0e51f4a1ddf7306e13acfd2e06d3443e4487e"
    },
    {
      "id": "def0a3c819b8f499da8d9d844ae9d528a682fbf02ec0e3708f18524032c7e537",
      "text": "For me, that means:",
      "hash": "0bf297b219d405506e23bf6291c8ed4ea799c8376efbdf86e40670f1f5611958"
    },
    {
      "id": "f93df43f3e6396d47f1962658565bf61ff4b89361f8ad37d72d6d002c3fd20aa",
      "text": "which repo I'm in",
      "hash": "84a74d49bb0182a28f1aeb3c852ddd8c3734c0bd35ba8142f7a92070f2e25e5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1cbe4fa00abef56fdecaf350314daa7e03657124f6e1ab668d178d25eb622d0",
      "text": "which Git branch I'm on",
      "hash": "95c09c08fb0dd6158ad37d2281abc84cca45f6097c11968f5ea9164fef75e76f"
    },
    {
      "id": "204b58491d93a13d8310b48135c6820b7e57f633974c85ba39a7ae7f60673ed4",
      "text": "whether I have staged or unstaged changes",
      "hash": "f2b9d623e7fe25ff76bd348f8f6730babb5a2b9ae59873e401b965893f1083cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "626e6e02fd22ae27b4ed1c1fab123d63e9b90b1e7f890d8a89b5f89c4a9dfd5c",
      "text": "how much of the context window this session has used",
      "hash": "b07d4c241551b8ae97e67db59274242f589f01621a8de471993ef3e364b23695"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a61c52296eacc45ef2c19f2e112cf1f2cc67a02959a80ca91ba00652adaa7f3",
      "text": "The repo and Git state help me avoid working in the wrong place. The context percentage helps me decide when to keep going, compact, or hand off to a fresh session.",
      "hash": "5ae4e015e2b3f5876d1946849fb0921fa766df41ec0e6579382505de73d97681"
    },
    {
      "id": "e373810469fae14f27283e6cacd58e35c9f1dd6a28feff61ecbbd5532015b06d",
      "text": "The exact format matters less than having the important signals visible without asking Claude Code to spend another turn checking them.",
      "hash": "50ea6984f3c7929af7b5c7705f5aa1083563643b786c2a7ff973f10a39d911c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "adae7a537a5b19500ef0a30ae7119012c2baa12f9d903cfedca10caadcda183d",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "8394fffa19bce15dfabe8d839cf1e8472f8227e67542f4a8eef79c496ef0b49f",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6a23ce0b929d464543fd886eeb4b4337b3d92a4d3b9a575097ed30e5041482c",
      "text": "The way this is set up is by using this",
      "hash": "6842a1d2c5b88c95ee2cf3f32ea636c8bb41627e4a57c856683f22117a3ad678"
    },
    {
      "id": "7129d00f762699d1a550fc597fba10e842cae1b9d3cd71c4c2e44f78ad9c200e",
      "text": "file inside",
      "hash": "d96693ae40a2cedb0c3cd960eb768583dfad39e119d319386cee28d9ec815dbe"
    },
    {
      "id": "c39312eab9d8ab808ccd6d6ea790c41e7e095b00c511dcc01c07dc670640ad6c",
      "text": "directory:",
      "hash": "cb76f2a353bd082f988cb18c8fe617f2cd6f84997c6e51e351985b8e69d89611"
    },
    {
      "id": "4150c4727d8ee323c945a0f615b3732139ee8f02cc3bef82044c8a2f9a3b0182",
      "text": "You can see it runs",
      "hash": "0660838360243475438d71250595d5236ec6025a6b6cedbba459fd61b3bc4c4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3ed007c1475053b0d309be77694400fb9702c4a9844c81c08387e295d57ab20",
      "text": ". This status line wrapper basically takes one status line command script.",
      "hash": "ac904e2082949490b4b7c7d33313d5393a5956311def538c99dcacf1e8ca08de"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d5a61231d52caf12c6423829a0b4eac2999bcde9101f91c09a344e69ad341d1",
      "text": "Then we also take the output from a CLI called",
      "hash": "ea22f06583416b6f9c7cbef70e31d3b4665e4783fc04b5d2eb500e0d463a1108"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e8a2c2315d5e24e749fbdfe90aaa357fb77e3ed06acc6ebbd77f140b515d0bd",
      "text": ". This basically lets me get the context percentage from it:",
      "hash": "9d37043e74f4793ad09b322b6732304811361cee508a0cacfa4817f4044f6a69"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfd841a1e473f645d10be322953b511359323011e50672374b09f6e5250c2617",
      "text": "Then we combine the outputs of these files.",
      "hash": "57fe118f974f759523a8050553ca1da593193d20e5827cc2ed051cdcd1a8644b"
    },
    {
      "id": "76ef4ed14bf212c85f8695752519bdbae4a0bb9ddc8454c6301d57bfac0b69d9",
      "text": "If you want to configure this yourself, here's how to set it up.",
      "hash": "e3c5a0306cc72fef71b983859b777a1e78e00a3b3db7005a9bbad14d2c6df7b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d262eefa24971573113ac89e0fb4e3499e8b6f6bec3ffa6dc5a8e34a18f2666",
      "text": "Step 1: Install ccstatusline",
      "hash": "3f61cb91925dce0ea5e5d4caa79e67e21a61e72066345919dfc1f81d93524829"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e60f72acdaec93a3a889c45dbdae775d752b0348253e9a803817d4b5abb42f1",
      "text": "First, install the ccstatusline package globally:",
      "hash": "31e95430cd4f72e024480b38cd39b3e0dd597478f99b5753dc3569a0c8821589"
    },
    {
      "id": "ecf64a3cbc5b83193a2b0dbe612c17141267a1b7cb331c164aa3e4217b80804d",
      "text": "Step 2: Configure ccstatusline",
      "hash": "f334c18f0d0dbc93b681b6cd7d48b8a6651b447c8d98139a0f9b8269554d219b"
    },
    {
      "id": "551c67559ec07ab93de793f103d3bd247fd652643cedbf6ceaee9c52b18642ca",
      "text": "Create the config file at",
      "hash": "557e088cca899aaf7fe5e80efd1e75ae07d2ba95f91231f01ccce87c2f6ec5e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "21cf781a60585badd2adac4bb4a8f6ccade2073ecd36baa99f18fc351e871fc6",
      "text": "The key part here is",
      "hash": "81707549dd4d9704b0d7b44856dd627ad5f7dd071884fb2e80c0c3726b196b8b"
    },
    {
      "id": "9cf7b073dc56237a3eaa66608ce6b0a78b565feaaf82ae9db34b9228e191dafc",
      "text": "which shows just the percentage without the \"Ctx:\" label, and",
      "hash": "4c7b95753970234d9482fbc8ed91c4519dc7687ee4fcf3e2bc17a143ab136b45"
    },
    {
      "id": "07ae1dd80fcdb8e62cd2f47b820cbe0c85d7b917f06ea306dd7257016b90f294",
      "text": "to match the color of the git numbers.",
      "hash": "4071940ab1f2e89f1cd5b6cbf0d74f661c71ea531d0473636cd40974871f7ec5"
    },
    {
      "id": "50afa8cf8b3393e234ddf5183d8e129088a422af2ca98ac4f6b385a22f5388ea",
      "text": "Step 3: Create the Git Status Script",
      "hash": "91203a4d98bdd602448300e80162513ab8ca70c593cf721d89c14acef757892f"
    },
    {
      "id": "abc4c232b3adc10918363207322c8a41c41c808332d8f1a221016fd7c801c0a6",
      "text": "Create",
      "hash": "4759498ac2a719c619e2c8cf8ee60af2d2407425e95d308eb208425b2a6d427a"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9871282cd7d3e558520636e4159bb4262941fad708417f03e96ed628ab8077d",
      "text": "Note:",
      "hash": "1150f05446e4d34452b320c78645f5d7f717b745ab3165abde97c15ddc650da5"
    },
    {
      "id": "4de32a4074fd2fced68a3d7a855efcbfe9458acee4d1489ccc8ee44717f1700c",
      "text": "Change",
      "hash": "c0bf75bd78bf9572596720d596bd5a20a5b9145cde0fe50dec1e783cb184d69b"
    },
    {
      "id": "9604a139409276970aa9b2406d5a6a6284d275c0f564751194b32eb0457ad6e2",
      "text": "on line 12 if your repositories live in a different directory.",
